## DATA PROTECTION & USER RIGHTS

This software processes personal data in accordance with the General Data
Protection Regulation (GDPR, EU 2016/679) and Swedish data protection laws.

**User Data:** Health, nutrition, and weight information is stored securely and
processed only for the purposes explicitly stated in our Privacy Policy
(https://calculeat.com/privacy).

**Your Rights:** You have the right to:
- Access your personal data (Article 15 GDPR)
- Correct inaccurate data (Article 16 GDPR)
- Request deletion (Article 17 GDPR)
- Data portability (Article 20 GDPR)
- Object to processing (Article 21 GDPR)

**Data Controller:** Jacob Hübner (calculeat.com)
For inquiries: contact@calculeat.com

**Supervisory Authority:** Integritetsskyddsmyndigheten (IMY)
https://www.imy.se
